      "spoken": {
        "role": "scene",
        "narration": "Here is the cause. Each list ends with a pattern meant to leave Markdown out. But the filter's default rule is that a file counts when any one pattern matches it, and 'not Markdown' matches nearly every file there is. So the Rust flag and the Node flag were on for almost every pull request."
