          "run": "45126948198"
        }
      },
      "burnIns": [],
      "spoken": {
        "role": "scene",
        "narration": "In the list of runs it looks like this: the same pull request, run again and again, each time triggered by a synchronize that carried someone else's merge. And through all of it, every red check that day was a flaky test or a red we had planned. Review found every real fault."
      },
      "durationMs": 23400
